==English==

===Etymology===
Originally referred to delaying the printing of a [[newspaper]] in order to change its content to accommodate the inclusion of late-breaking news.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-stop the presses.ogg|a=AU}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|*}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} {{non-gloss|An exclamation used to introduce especially [[new]], [[important]], [[surprising]], or [[recent]] developments.}}

